# Alpha OS — XFCE 4.20.4 desktop — Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (resolute)
# Provenance: names verified as exact matches against the resolute
# binary-amd64 Packages indexes on archive.ubuntu.com (released 23 Apr 2026).
#
# Verified from Contents-amd64.gz, `xfce4-session` 4.20.4 ships BOTH
#   xsessions/xfce.desktop
#   wayland-sessions/xfce-wayland.desktop   (native, labwc-backed)
# so XFCE here is genuinely dual-stack from one package.
#
# `xfce4-mixer` is GONE in resolute; `xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin` replaces it
# and is the mixer Alpha OS ships.

